{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026rALQBoE3PI1793242956.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>施焯日近日於社交平台上載與童星田宇希的最新合照，並附上兩人昔日合作無綫劇集《黯夜守護者》時的舊照，感嘆時光飛逝。</p><p></p><p>施焯日在社交網留言表示：「時間轉眼流走，當年你中一 而家Year1，嗰種震撼好似一拳打咗落我度咁，原來人唔係慢慢變老，係一瞬間」。從上載的相片可見，昔日帶有Baby Fat的田宇希如今已長高不少，身高甚至超越了施焯日。施焯日更透露田宇希現時身高約183cm左右，展現出「暴風式成長」，搖身一變成一位帥氣型男。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"a1ba5469-3c2d-401a-93e1-4a858231dd98.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026O9pXVOiEw31793242956.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"52324324-7581-492d-a0fa-2462c5fd531b.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026E1T1EVUMY31793242955.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>據悉，田宇希過去曾入讀家燕媽媽藝術中心，童星出身的他演出經驗相當豐富，曾參演過不少劇集作品，包括《超能老豆》、《雜警奇兵》及《失憶24小時》等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:42:00.765022+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":284,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T03:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T20:18:11.687065+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T03:38:24.127077+00:00","content_hash":"feff6a20e2b3c4c638f9ae7def16ef74acbe99a53685fa94ae1225799302505f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:42:00.765022+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}